<p>Full company name is Ventures Stores Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: In Q4 1996 Venture recorded nonrecurring pretax charges of $50.0 million or $1.72 per share compared to nonrecurring pretax charges of $20.8 million or $0.78 per share taken during the fourth quarter 1995.</p>
<p>Most of the 1996 charges were taken for inventory markdowns and expenses associated with store closings.</p>
<p>A total of $45.7 million or $1.65 per share in nonrecurring charges were taken during fiscal 1995, in connection with the completion of the image builder program, store closings, work force reductions and the repositioning program.</p>
